of how some parts of the brain work and are

00:07:13.050 --> 00:07:20.330
connected. What we don't have yet, I would
argue, is a way of bridging mental experience

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:27.409
with the brain in a coherent model that allows
for mental intention. And so, I would say

00:07:27.409 --> 00:07:35.050
we still are a ways off from solving the mind-
brain problem. Evolving concepts of mind and

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:41.240
self, spurred by scientific explorations,
have helped to change how societies are governed.

00:07:41.240 --> 00:07:46.560
Basing our hopes more on the real world. The
exciting question now is whether our dazzling

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:51.080
new technology can help us understand what
we're really talking about when we speak of

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:56.850
the mind, the self, and even perhaps, the
soul.

