Called? Say that slowly.

00:48:11.440 --> 00:48:17.630
An Essay Concerning Human Understanding. In
that book he advances a theory of what a self

00:48:17.630 --> 00:48:23.600
is and what makes somebody the same self over
time. And his answer, as it's most usually

00:48:23.600 --> 00:48:30.390
interpreted, is memory. Memory is what links
