And morality is roughly the sense of-

00:51:06.440 --> 00:51:09.210
Morality. I mean some of our values are good
and bad, but other like other demands like

00:51:09.210 --> 00:51:14.680
good and bad art or good and bad food. But
morality is about- about the social domain

00:51:14.680 --> 00:51:19.060
and the values that we have and morality are
