00:51:24.090 --> 00:51:29.300
think they deserve to be punished in some
way. So morality is- is really about regulating

00:51:29.300 --> 00:51:32.580
social behavior in a way that concords which
concords with our preference.

00:51:32.580 --> 00:51:36.450
All right. So you're talking about identity
political.

00:51:36.450 --> 00:51:40.480
So we've measured in a lot of ways. If you
